WEBVTT

00:17.090 --> 00:19.530
[Twenty-three years ago]

00:38.710 --> 00:39.240
Dad!

00:41.030 --> 00:41.790
Dad!

00:41.840 --> 00:42.640
Let me go!

00:43.000 --> 00:44.170
I can definitely get the money!

00:44.170 --> 00:45.320
I can definitely get the money!

00:45.320 --> 00:46.150
Cao San.

00:46.470 --> 00:48.000
You can never get the money.

00:48.470 --> 00:50.200
I'm helping you.

00:50.710 --> 00:51.880
Every trade

00:51.880 --> 00:53.390
has its own rules.

00:53.750 --> 00:54.710
You can only

00:55.030 --> 00:57.500
get the money more easily
if you're crippled.

00:57.500 --> 00:59.040
You're actually not willing?

00:59.040 --> 01:01.920
So many people out there
are begging me for this.

01:04.120 --> 01:05.870
I wish you prosperity

01:06.400 --> 01:07.760
and wealth!

01:08.000 --> 01:10.039
May your house
be filled with gold and silver!

01:10.039 --> 01:12.200
May you have a happy life!

01:12.200 --> 01:14.680
A happy life!

01:15.330 --> 01:16.250
How is it?

01:16.280 --> 01:17.130
Leader.

01:17.230 --> 01:18.960
The lamb spine is almost ready.

01:28.620 --> 01:30.700
It's rare to see such a handsome face.

01:31.590 --> 01:33.229
Let him sell his body.

01:34.060 --> 01:35.310
Thank you, Leader.

01:35.870 --> 01:37.150
Thank you, Leader.

03:19.410 --> 03:23.250
[A Prophet]

03:23.970 --> 03:26.390
[Episode 14]

04:17.720 --> 04:18.680
Miss Jiang?

04:19.430 --> 04:20.360
Mr. Cao.

04:20.670 --> 04:22.000
What are you doing here?

04:22.100 --> 04:23.200
Don't even mention it.

04:23.200 --> 04:25.480
My General Longxiang ran in through there,

04:25.480 --> 04:27.430
through this crack.

04:27.450 --> 04:28.690
Can you...

04:29.800 --> 04:32.610
But this is the Master's room.

04:33.220 --> 04:34.430
It's not convenient to disturb him.

04:34.430 --> 04:36.090
I'll just go in and take a look.

04:36.310 --> 04:38.070
The General helped you get revenge
after all,

04:38.070 --> 04:38.820
didn't he?

04:40.990 --> 04:41.950
Then I'll give it a try.

04:41.950 --> 04:42.580
Try it.

04:52.820 --> 04:53.460
Master.

04:53.990 --> 04:55.190
Sorry to disturb you.

04:55.260 --> 04:57.220
This is Mr. Cao.

04:57.580 --> 04:58.990
His cricket ran in.

04:59.100 --> 05:01.180
Can you let him in to take a look?

05:04.340 --> 05:06.000
Sorry to disturb you, Master.

05:06.580 --> 05:07.340
It's fine.

05:08.020 --> 05:09.350
Please come in, Mr. Cao.

05:26.060 --> 05:26.990
Mr. Cao,

05:27.010 --> 05:28.210
please find it as soon as possible.

05:28.210 --> 05:29.650
The Master needs to rest.

05:30.070 --> 05:30.750
Okay.

05:39.460 --> 05:40.659
Isn't it right there?

05:41.080 --> 05:42.250
Where?

05:48.760 --> 05:49.360
Mr. Cao...

05:51.550 --> 05:53.350
How did you step on it and kill it?

05:53.380 --> 05:54.990
I'm really sorry, Mr. Cao.

05:55.220 --> 05:56.620
I was too careless and...

05:57.110 --> 05:58.110
It's all my fault.

05:58.220 --> 05:59.080
How about this?

05:59.310 --> 06:00.460
I'll compensate you with 10 of them.

06:00.460 --> 06:01.990
What are you talking about?

06:02.040 --> 06:02.700
Even if you compensate me with a hundred,

06:02.700 --> 06:04.430
it can't compare to my General.

06:05.220 --> 06:06.990
Immeasurable blessings.

06:07.280 --> 06:08.840
What a sin.

06:09.070 --> 06:10.110
This little thing

06:10.220 --> 06:12.020
shouldn't have died here today.

06:12.340 --> 06:14.630
Then let me meddle in this business

06:15.930 --> 06:16.980
and save its life.

06:18.870 --> 06:19.550
You?

06:23.630 --> 06:25.140
Can it still be saved?

06:50.050 --> 06:50.690
It...

06:51.340 --> 06:52.870
It really came back to life!

06:53.460 --> 06:55.260
Master, you're indeed amazing.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.710
Master, you are truly a god.

06:57.760 --> 06:58.840
I was just wondering

06:58.840 --> 07:01.240
why the room
was glowing with golden light.

07:03.780 --> 07:04.670
Mr. Cao.

07:05.900 --> 07:07.140
What else did you see?

07:08.630 --> 07:09.020
Oh, right.

07:09.020 --> 07:10.070
I also saw

07:10.950 --> 07:11.950
that sofa...

07:13.340 --> 07:14.750
It was golden,

07:15.140 --> 07:17.200
and there were dragons coiling on it.

07:17.340 --> 07:18.220
Just like...

07:18.780 --> 07:20.440
the thing the Emperor sits on—

07:20.680 --> 07:21.740
the Dragon Throne.

07:25.430 --> 07:26.140
Sir.

07:26.750 --> 07:28.280
What you see may not be real.

07:28.310 --> 07:29.680
What you see may be real.

07:30.110 --> 07:31.990
If you glimpse the hidden mysteries,

07:31.990 --> 07:33.140
the hidden dragon...

07:33.140 --> 07:34.340
will reveal itself.

07:36.340 --> 07:37.310
Miss Jiang.

07:37.550 --> 07:39.030
Please tell the Fifth Master

07:39.030 --> 07:40.340
that things have come to this,

07:40.340 --> 07:42.380
and we can only let nature
take its course.

07:42.380 --> 07:44.630
I can't be of any help.

07:44.870 --> 07:46.130
I'll take my leave now.

07:46.260 --> 07:47.340
Thank you, Master.

07:47.630 --> 07:49.140
I have prepared some humble gifts

07:49.140 --> 07:51.260
and had them sent to Yunhe Temple.

07:51.550 --> 07:52.920
Next time I have the chance,

07:52.920 --> 07:55.050
I will definitely visit you in person.

08:05.110 --> 08:06.310
He really is a master.

08:10.190 --> 08:11.310
You have no idea.

08:11.580 --> 08:13.310
That jar was smashed to pieces.

08:13.380 --> 08:14.900
The Second Master looked at me

08:14.900 --> 08:15.900
like he wanted to kill me.

08:15.900 --> 08:16.900
I'm telling you,

08:17.110 --> 08:18.430
I can't go back to the gang.

08:18.430 --> 08:18.780
I...

08:18.990 --> 08:19.780
Big Teapot!

08:19.990 --> 08:20.310
Second Master.

08:20.310 --> 08:22.460
Do you know
how much my Xuande Jar is worth?

08:22.460 --> 08:24.720
I've shown you more than enough respect!

08:25.980 --> 08:26.930
I'll pay for it.

08:28.900 --> 08:29.630
You'll pay?

08:30.110 --> 08:31.430
With what? Your life?

08:32.950 --> 08:34.250
I'm telling you, Shangguan Chengming,

08:34.250 --> 08:36.250
you won't get any money from Cao San.

08:36.429 --> 08:37.289
Do you know him?

08:37.429 --> 08:38.610
He bought a fake antique before,

08:38.610 --> 08:40.909
and he immediately turned those scammers
into human-like animals.

08:40.909 --> 08:41.700
Now when he buys things,

08:41.700 --> 08:42.860
he has someone appraise them.

08:42.860 --> 08:44.230
Do you really think he's stupid?

08:44.230 --> 08:45.830
You can't pull off this scam!

08:45.980 --> 08:47.840
Isn't this exactly what you want?

08:48.070 --> 08:50.100
Why don't you hold back a little longer,

08:50.100 --> 08:51.620
wait for Cao San to deal with me,

08:51.620 --> 08:52.680
and enjoy the show?

08:56.460 --> 08:57.100
Fine.

08:59.100 --> 09:00.220
Let's wait and see.

09:07.150 --> 09:07.500
Are you okay?

09:07.500 --> 09:08.150
I'm fine.

09:08.500 --> 09:10.390
I had to take this kick sooner or later.

09:10.390 --> 09:12.390
At least I can go back to the gang now.

09:24.490 --> 09:25.300
San.

09:26.310 --> 09:27.340
Am I pretty?

09:31.820 --> 09:33.580
Are you shaking your head or nodding?

09:33.580 --> 09:34.580
What do you mean?

09:34.790 --> 09:36.390
I got a stiff neck last night.

09:37.670 --> 09:38.740
My neck is stiff.

09:39.670 --> 09:42.070
Your neck is the only stiff thing
about you.

09:42.700 --> 09:43.340
Let's go.

09:54.460 --> 09:55.870
So pretty!

09:56.050 --> 09:57.260
Take a look from here.

10:05.580 --> 10:05.950
Alright.

10:05.950 --> 10:07.280
This one is pretty good.

10:09.860 --> 10:10.820
Mr. Cao?

10:13.400 --> 10:14.670
Isn't this Miss Jiang?

10:15.030 --> 10:15.860
Mr. Cao.

10:16.310 --> 10:17.510
What brings you here?

10:17.550 --> 10:18.270
I...

10:19.910 --> 10:21.430
I wanted to pick out a gift for you

10:21.430 --> 10:22.700
to thank you.

10:22.700 --> 10:24.100
I'll pick a dress for you.

10:24.340 --> 10:25.870
You are too polite, Mr. Cao.

10:26.100 --> 10:27.900
I should be the one thanking you.

10:27.950 --> 10:29.680
If it weren't for your General,

10:29.950 --> 10:31.500
I wouldn't have been able
to vent my anger.

10:31.500 --> 10:32.270
Look.

10:32.270 --> 10:33.790
You're the one being too polite.

10:33.790 --> 10:35.320
Well, it's perfect timing.

10:35.390 --> 10:36.700
Mr. Cao, take a look.

10:37.340 --> 10:39.150
Does this dress look good on me?

10:39.500 --> 10:40.700
Let me see.

10:42.500 --> 10:43.980
What fabric is this?

10:44.150 --> 10:45.820
Why does it feel so good?

10:46.100 --> 10:48.340
What feels so good?

10:49.510 --> 10:50.540
I didn't!

10:50.620 --> 10:51.980
What didn't you do?

10:54.310 --> 10:55.950
I just heard you say

10:55.980 --> 10:59.170
you wanted to give a gift to a Miss Jiang.

11:00.200 --> 11:01.790
Who is Miss Jiang?

11:03.030 --> 11:04.690
Miss Jiang, please excuse us.

11:04.860 --> 11:06.860
This is my wife.

11:07.190 --> 11:07.700
Honey,

11:07.740 --> 11:09.150
this is Miss Jiang.

11:09.190 --> 11:10.580
The gold bars we won

11:10.580 --> 11:12.190
are all thanks to Miss Jiang!

11:12.820 --> 11:14.030
So it's you, Mrs. Cao.

11:21.170 --> 11:23.020
Are you guys doing wholesale?

11:24.820 --> 11:25.860
What a coincidence.

11:25.860 --> 11:27.660
You even got the same one as mine.

11:27.820 --> 11:28.580
San,

11:28.790 --> 11:30.700
between the two of us,

11:30.700 --> 11:32.430
who looks better in this dress?

11:34.190 --> 11:36.220
If you ask me...

11:37.620 --> 11:38.950
If you ask me,

11:39.070 --> 11:40.190
it's really hard...

11:40.190 --> 11:41.430
to tell.

11:42.620 --> 11:44.340
You're so sweet today.

11:45.740 --> 11:47.010
Since it's such a coincidence,

11:47.010 --> 11:48.080
how about this?

11:48.500 --> 11:51.290
Put everything
Mrs. Cao takes a fancy to today

11:51.740 --> 11:52.790
on my tab.

11:52.990 --> 11:54.790
No, no, this isn't appropriate.

11:55.500 --> 11:57.150
What's wrong with it?

11:57.990 --> 11:59.790
Since Miss Jiang is so generous,

12:00.030 --> 12:02.030
I'll gladly accept.

12:02.460 --> 12:03.820
Let's go take a look.

12:04.100 --> 12:05.270
Come on, make way.

12:08.190 --> 12:10.100
This pattern is also nice.

12:11.390 --> 12:13.150
This one with a bit of fur is quite good.

12:13.150 --> 12:13.910
Take a look at this one.

12:13.910 --> 12:14.910
This one...

12:15.190 --> 12:15.670
No.

12:15.730 --> 12:17.460
As for the ones in other colors...

12:17.460 --> 12:19.460
I think they all suit me pretty well.

12:20.220 --> 12:21.220
What do you think?

12:21.310 --> 12:23.150
Wrap them all up for Mrs. Cao.

12:24.220 --> 12:25.220
Really?

12:25.370 --> 12:27.890
Miss Jiang, you're so generous!

12:28.190 --> 12:29.660
Let's go. I'll pay.

12:30.260 --> 12:31.260
Thank you, Madam.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.360
Thank you for your generosity.

12:45.700 --> 12:46.950
You bastard.

12:46.980 --> 12:48.390
Whenever you see a vixen,

12:48.980 --> 12:51.340
you can't take your eyes off her.

12:51.910 --> 12:52.500
Honey,

12:52.670 --> 12:54.790
this lady is from the north.

12:55.070 --> 12:56.580
She has powerful connections.

12:56.580 --> 12:57.790
We should get along with her.

12:57.790 --> 12:59.030
Why do I feel like

12:59.640 --> 13:01.640
if she gives me one yuan today,

13:01.820 --> 13:04.620
she'll trick you out of 10 yuan tomorrow?

13:04.650 --> 13:06.100
Don't you think so?

13:06.540 --> 13:07.460
Blockhead.

13:07.740 --> 13:08.500
Honey.

13:09.910 --> 13:10.620
I am

13:10.860 --> 13:12.700
the smartest person in the world.

13:12.700 --> 13:13.460
Remember,

13:13.580 --> 13:16.310
you're the most blockheaded person
in the world.

13:31.220 --> 13:32.550
What do you say, Eunuch?

13:32.860 --> 13:34.030
Is this real or fake?

13:34.460 --> 13:35.460
It can't be fake.

13:35.580 --> 13:36.700
In the palace,

13:36.700 --> 13:37.790
I've handled this treasure

13:37.790 --> 13:40.500
so many times.

13:40.860 --> 13:41.790
It's absolutely real.

13:41.790 --> 13:43.050
My eyes can't be wrong.

13:43.220 --> 13:44.390
See?

13:45.670 --> 13:46.470
What did I say?

13:46.820 --> 13:48.680
I just need to stay clear-minded.

13:49.070 --> 13:50.500
That's hard to say.

13:51.550 --> 13:53.460
The thing can be real,

13:53.700 --> 13:54.950
but this person...

13:55.390 --> 13:56.820
may not be.

13:57.170 --> 13:58.170
It sounds like

13:58.190 --> 14:00.240
you know the tricks of the trade.

14:00.580 --> 14:01.860
Tell us about them.

14:02.670 --> 14:03.740
Let me tell you.

14:04.340 --> 14:06.430
When the Empress Dowager was buried,

14:06.550 --> 14:09.030
there were countless treasures.

14:09.860 --> 14:12.700
The Xuande Jar was one of them.

14:13.150 --> 14:14.220
But later,

14:15.100 --> 14:17.300
the Empress Dowager's tomb was robbed.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.790
The person holding it

14:20.580 --> 14:22.740
may not be a prince.

14:24.700 --> 14:25.740
Did you hear that?

14:25.910 --> 14:27.820
Those people are all scammers.

14:27.910 --> 14:29.040
Alright, scammers.

14:29.070 --> 14:30.150
Did she scam my money?

14:30.150 --> 14:31.500
We even won some money.

14:31.500 --> 14:33.430
Do you remember those gold bars we won?

14:33.430 --> 14:35.580
They're all real gold.

14:35.610 --> 14:37.700
If they hadn't given you
a little taste of the benefits,

14:37.700 --> 14:39.220
how could you have fallen for it?

14:39.220 --> 14:40.100
Exactly.

14:40.580 --> 14:43.500
This scam is called the Golden Hook.

14:43.980 --> 14:45.100
Golden Hook?

14:45.270 --> 14:45.980
Leader.

14:46.700 --> 14:49.430
She didn't mention money to you this time,
right?

14:49.860 --> 14:52.270
Next time, she'll pull the hook back.

14:58.430 --> 14:59.580
I'm not stupid.

14:59.680 --> 15:01.660
If she uses the Golden Fork on me, I...

15:01.660 --> 15:03.230
Golden Hook.

15:04.100 --> 15:05.190
She dares to use a hook on me?

15:05.190 --> 15:05.910
If she does that,

15:05.910 --> 15:07.570
I'll turn her into a human dog!

15:09.320 --> 15:16.940
♪ In spring, the wind blows
and all things grow ♪

15:17.640 --> 15:26.440
♪ Flowers are red, leaves are green,
and grass is fresh ♪

16:29.860 --> 16:31.390
The sun is almost setting.

16:31.820 --> 16:32.910
I'm afraid today,

16:33.270 --> 16:34.820
he probably won't take the bait.

16:34.820 --> 16:35.700
No rush.

16:36.110 --> 16:37.660
I bet he will come today.

16:38.140 --> 16:39.860
Your conceited look

16:41.220 --> 16:43.150
really resembles the Sect Master.

16:44.430 --> 16:46.540
No one knows a father
better than his son does.

16:46.540 --> 16:47.910
You...

16:48.580 --> 16:50.240
planted a thought in his mind.

16:50.650 --> 16:52.310
Aren't the Tianxiang Sect's scams...

16:52.310 --> 16:53.910
all about planting thoughts

16:54.150 --> 16:56.060
in people's minds?

16:56.790 --> 16:58.220
But setting him up

16:58.500 --> 16:59.580
is like

16:59.740 --> 17:01.670
provoking someone you shouldn't.

17:01.960 --> 17:02.790
Understand?

17:04.589 --> 17:05.390
Miss.

17:05.980 --> 17:08.500
Then what do you want?

17:11.349 --> 17:12.670
What do I want?

17:15.670 --> 17:17.670
My mother used to tell me all the time

17:18.829 --> 17:20.630
that whatever kind of life
you're meant to live,

17:20.630 --> 17:21.630
that's your fate,

17:21.829 --> 17:23.230
and you have to accept it.

17:23.460 --> 17:24.740
When I joined the gang,

17:25.349 --> 17:26.700
everyone said

17:26.780 --> 17:28.109
the same thing.

17:29.850 --> 17:31.200
They all say

17:31.430 --> 17:32.780
you can't fight fate.

17:34.380 --> 17:35.790
But I want to try anyway.

17:41.580 --> 17:42.450
He's here!

18:06.670 --> 18:08.830
We meet again, sir.

18:09.020 --> 18:11.190
Master, I have something

18:11.190 --> 18:13.110
I need you to take a look at.

18:24.150 --> 18:24.830
Master,

18:25.020 --> 18:26.110
what is this?

18:27.540 --> 18:28.390
Sir,

18:29.760 --> 18:31.190
where did you get this?

18:32.590 --> 18:33.910
I just took a bath,

18:33.940 --> 18:36.340
and after that,
my body was covered in this.

19:57.360 --> 19:58.190
It seems

19:58.530 --> 20:01.130
the hidden dragon has revealed itself!

20:16.410 --> 20:20.890
Long live Your Majesty!

20:37.540 --> 20:41.200
Long live Your Majesty!

20:41.350 --> 20:44.910
Long live Your Majesty!

20:44.940 --> 20:47.940
Long live Your Majesty!

21:09.760 --> 21:10.470
Master?

21:17.830 --> 21:18.590
Master,

21:19.460 --> 21:20.410
where are they?

21:22.500 --> 21:24.870
Who are you talking about?

21:26.540 --> 21:27.870
The people who were just

21:28.110 --> 21:30.740
kneeling here worshipping me?

21:31.630 --> 21:32.980
Leader, perhaps you've been

21:32.980 --> 21:35.040
overworking yourself these past two weeks.

21:35.040 --> 21:38.170
There have only been
the three of us here this whole time.

21:39.630 --> 21:40.110
Well...

21:40.500 --> 21:41.700
How is that possible?

21:42.060 --> 21:42.950
Just now,

21:43.350 --> 21:44.950
didn't I get up?

21:44.950 --> 21:46.020
And over there...

21:46.110 --> 21:47.110
It was this thick.

21:48.170 --> 21:49.260
And then they were...

21:49.260 --> 21:50.660
They were kneeling here.

21:51.910 --> 21:52.630
Master!

21:52.660 --> 21:54.590
Weren't they kneeling right here?

21:54.880 --> 21:57.440
Come on, right over there.

21:58.300 --> 21:59.700
Doggie, did you see them?

21:59.780 --> 22:00.350
Master,

22:00.950 --> 22:02.980
I... I'm sure
there were just the three of us.

22:02.980 --> 22:05.580
I clearly saw Miss Jiang
kneeling right there.

22:05.820 --> 22:06.680
Master, you...

22:07.170 --> 22:08.100
Get out of my way!

22:09.780 --> 22:10.590
Leader, lately,

22:10.590 --> 22:12.740
have you been seeing strange visions?

22:14.460 --> 22:15.860
I saw the candles were...

22:18.630 --> 22:19.540
And the water.

22:19.780 --> 22:20.980
The water was like...

22:22.140 --> 22:23.700
They were all kneeling there,

22:23.700 --> 22:25.060
calling me Your Majesty.

22:25.060 --> 22:29.430
Long live Your Majesty!

22:39.640 --> 22:41.110
The Qian hexagram changes to Xun.

22:41.110 --> 22:43.440
The hidden dragon emerges from the abyss.

22:43.910 --> 22:45.500
Why is it such a hexagram?

22:45.830 --> 22:46.680
Master,

22:47.240 --> 22:49.040
what does it mean?

22:49.200 --> 22:50.480
The year is Guichou,

22:51.500 --> 22:54.160
which should be the second year
of the Republic.

22:54.300 --> 22:56.030
Sect Leader Cao, has something

22:56.200 --> 22:57.810
grown on your back?

22:57.880 --> 22:58.680
My back?

23:02.060 --> 23:03.630
No. What could have grown?

23:04.110 --> 23:05.150
A dragon vein.

23:07.110 --> 23:07.910
A dragon vein?

23:08.060 --> 23:09.260
What is a dragon vein?

23:11.190 --> 23:11.740
Master.

23:12.630 --> 23:13.390
Master,

23:14.150 --> 23:15.060
is it this?

23:22.150 --> 23:23.610
It really is a dragon vein!

23:26.300 --> 23:27.150
No.

23:27.540 --> 23:28.780
This is just a scar.

23:28.860 --> 23:30.250
When I was young,

23:30.630 --> 23:31.830
an old geezer

23:31.910 --> 23:33.570
burned me with boiling water.

23:33.830 --> 23:35.430
How could it be a dragon vein?

23:35.660 --> 23:37.630
I have never met you before.

23:37.650 --> 23:39.100
Why would I make that up?

23:39.460 --> 23:41.680
A dragon vein
is where the dragon's energy lies,

23:41.680 --> 23:43.180
and it has thousands of manifestations.

23:43.180 --> 23:44.520
When a person is insignificant,

23:44.520 --> 23:47.780
the dragon vein is trapped
in the shallows with its master.

23:48.410 --> 23:49.740
Think about it, Leader.

23:50.300 --> 23:52.300
Ever since you got this scar,

23:52.500 --> 23:55.160
hasn't your life
been getting better and better?

23:55.160 --> 23:57.000
If you put it that way,

23:58.870 --> 23:59.910
it seems...

24:00.650 --> 24:02.170
that's really the case.

24:02.540 --> 24:03.460
Although

24:03.690 --> 24:06.210
that old geezer didn't treat me well,

24:06.980 --> 24:08.460
if it weren't for him,

24:09.520 --> 24:11.910
I would have starved to death
on the streets long ago.

24:11.910 --> 24:13.630
All encounters

24:14.300 --> 24:15.910
are destined.

24:16.980 --> 24:20.540
It seems you have the destiny
of a true dragon, Leader.

24:21.790 --> 24:22.630
Me?

24:23.680 --> 24:25.810
My parents died when I was young.

24:26.940 --> 24:29.510
I wandered the streets
begging for a living.

24:29.820 --> 24:31.010
With my fate,

24:32.260 --> 24:33.790
how could I be a true dragon?

24:35.020 --> 24:36.350
Leader, think about...

24:37.150 --> 24:38.260
Zhu Yuanzhang.

24:39.630 --> 24:40.670
Right, Master.

24:40.910 --> 24:41.770
Zhu Yuanzhang.

24:42.070 --> 24:43.080
Before he became emperor,

24:43.080 --> 24:44.670
he was a beggar just like us.

24:45.150 --> 24:45.750
Is that so?

24:48.940 --> 24:50.980
I... I know about this.

24:52.630 --> 24:53.890
Wait a moment, Leader.

24:56.150 --> 24:57.150
Thirty years ago,

24:57.740 --> 24:58.590
my mentor

24:58.640 --> 25:01.240
was the last director
of the Astronomy Bureau.

25:01.540 --> 25:02.590
This item was a treasure
of the Astronomy Bureau

25:02.590 --> 25:04.870
used to suppress the Luo River Dragon.

25:05.260 --> 25:06.790
It's the Ziwei Star Mirror.

25:07.540 --> 25:09.070
Whether what's on your body

25:09.360 --> 25:11.470
is a miracle or an anomaly,

25:11.790 --> 25:13.110
one look will tell.

25:13.780 --> 25:14.430
Well...

25:15.500 --> 25:16.430
Shall we do it?

25:17.350 --> 25:18.010
Let's do it.

25:18.460 --> 25:19.390
Come on, Master.

25:50.050 --> 25:50.810
Master!

25:50.870 --> 25:51.540
Look!

25:52.020 --> 25:53.340
It appeared!

26:00.670 --> 26:02.350
Honey!

26:02.350 --> 26:03.670
I have a dragon vein!

26:03.830 --> 26:05.460
Honey, I really am a dragon!

26:05.490 --> 26:06.410
I'm a dragon!

26:06.590 --> 26:07.390
Honey!

26:09.110 --> 26:09.830
Where is the Madam?

26:09.830 --> 26:10.390
Master,

26:10.420 --> 26:11.740
Madam's brother suddenly fell ill,

26:11.740 --> 26:13.260
so she went back to her parents' home.

26:13.260 --> 26:14.870
She went back to her parents' home?

26:14.870 --> 26:16.800
Why did she have to go back to her fu—

26:17.600 --> 26:19.660
her father's home at a time like this?

26:21.320 --> 26:22.360
You can leave now.

26:34.150 --> 26:34.830
Master!

26:35.060 --> 26:35.830
Master!

26:36.960 --> 26:38.490
Miss Jiang is here to visit.

26:38.610 --> 26:39.540
Will you see her?

26:39.630 --> 26:40.700
She's here?

26:41.110 --> 26:41.780
Invite her in.

26:41.780 --> 26:43.430
Yes.

26:51.190 --> 26:51.990
Hello.

26:55.980 --> 26:56.910
Miss Jiang,

26:57.350 --> 26:58.020
please.

26:58.460 --> 26:59.260
Mr. Cao.

26:59.490 --> 27:01.160
This is the whiskey my friend Summer

27:01.160 --> 27:03.530
brought back from abroad.

27:03.890 --> 27:06.090
I brought it today for you to taste.

27:07.310 --> 27:08.110
I...

27:08.590 --> 27:09.460
often...

27:10.190 --> 27:11.260
drink...

27:11.450 --> 27:12.580
this kind of "key."

27:13.150 --> 27:13.870
Come on.

27:14.100 --> 27:15.540
Take away Ma's

27:15.910 --> 27:17.040
and pour this "key."

27:17.260 --> 27:18.390
I came today

27:18.420 --> 27:20.450
specifically to apologize to you.

27:20.780 --> 27:21.740
Last time,

27:21.980 --> 27:23.980
I accidentally stepped on your General.

27:23.980 --> 27:25.390
I hope you...

27:26.350 --> 27:27.220
can forgive me.

27:27.300 --> 27:29.170
You're being too polite.

27:29.670 --> 27:31.110
Compared to a beauty,

27:31.140 --> 27:32.320
this little beast of mine

27:32.320 --> 27:33.710
is nothing.

27:33.860 --> 27:36.170
If you like it, I'll give it to you.

27:36.500 --> 27:37.700
As the saying goes,

27:38.200 --> 27:39.870
a gentleman does not take
what others love.

27:39.870 --> 27:40.670
Mr. Cao,

27:41.060 --> 27:42.350
your kind intention

27:42.830 --> 27:43.870
is enough.

27:52.780 --> 27:54.020
How is it, Mr. Cao?

27:54.220 --> 27:54.980
Does this

27:55.010 --> 27:55.620
"key"

27:57.190 --> 27:58.280
suit your taste?

28:00.840 --> 28:02.190
I like this "key."

28:02.700 --> 28:03.430
Come on,

28:04.120 --> 28:04.980
pour the "key."

28:07.540 --> 28:08.740
May I ask, Miss Jiang,

28:08.740 --> 28:11.590
when you said you lived in the north,
did you mean...

28:11.590 --> 28:12.540
Peiping?

28:13.500 --> 28:14.260
Exactly.

28:15.700 --> 28:17.700
Then why did you

28:18.300 --> 28:19.740
come all the way here?

28:21.540 --> 28:22.460
Mr. Cao.

28:23.500 --> 28:25.830
You're interrogating me like a prisoner.

28:25.950 --> 28:27.060
I wouldn't dare.

28:27.170 --> 28:28.970
It's just that you look like

28:29.260 --> 28:30.720
you have an extraordinary temperament,

28:30.720 --> 28:33.220
and the people you know
are either rich or noble.

28:33.220 --> 28:34.500
So I figure that you

28:34.910 --> 28:37.350
came all the way to our small place

28:37.380 --> 28:39.970
probably not just for sightseeing.

28:41.260 --> 28:42.700
I didn't expect you

28:43.430 --> 28:44.780
to have such sharp eyes.

28:45.500 --> 28:46.190
Never mind.

28:46.950 --> 28:48.750
It seems I can't hide it anymore.

28:49.460 --> 28:51.110
I came here this time to...

29:02.460 --> 29:03.460
Miss Jiang,

29:04.190 --> 29:05.670
please speak freely.

29:08.670 --> 29:09.390
Mr. Cao,

29:09.700 --> 29:12.350
please do not tell anyone else about this.

29:16.500 --> 29:17.700
My real surname is...

29:17.740 --> 29:19.020
Yehenara.

29:20.130 --> 29:22.240
I came here this time to find someone.

29:24.700 --> 29:25.430
Then Ye...

29:25.740 --> 29:26.780
Then Miss Jiang,

29:27.190 --> 29:28.020
who

29:28.390 --> 29:29.520
are you looking for?

29:31.740 --> 29:33.500
Mr. Cao, did you know
that in the second year of Tianming,

29:33.500 --> 29:35.020
a meteorite fell in Laoya Ridge

29:35.020 --> 29:36.020
in Jianzhou?

29:38.350 --> 29:39.750
The Donghua Records says

29:39.780 --> 29:43.780
the stone was as dark as iron,
with hidden dragon-scale patterns.

29:43.870 --> 29:45.260
It perfectly matches the dream
Emperor Taizu

29:45.260 --> 29:48.720
once had of a three-legged golden crow
perched on Mount White.

29:49.460 --> 29:52.740
Last month, the Liao River ran dry for 3 days
because there was no rain.

29:52.740 --> 29:53.930
Someone dug half of a stone tablet

29:53.930 --> 29:55.270
out of the mud.

29:55.480 --> 29:57.640
To our surprise, it bore a prophecy

29:58.190 --> 30:00.050
that the Astronomical Bureau
of the Qing Dynasty

30:00.050 --> 30:01.850
had never dared report:

30:02.740 --> 30:05.060
"When the Black River flows west,

30:06.100 --> 30:08.860
the hidden dragon emerges from the pass."

30:09.910 --> 30:10.390
Well...

30:11.280 --> 30:12.120
Miss Jiang.

30:14.020 --> 30:14.980
Miss Jiang?

30:16.330 --> 30:17.050
So,

30:17.160 --> 30:18.820
the person you are looking for

30:19.460 --> 30:21.350
must be a big shot, right?

30:25.950 --> 30:26.740
Mr. Cao.

30:26.830 --> 30:28.220
I'm terribly sorry.

30:28.420 --> 30:30.900
I usually can't handle alcohol well.

30:32.280 --> 30:34.880
I tend to talk nonsense when I'm drunk.

30:35.300 --> 30:36.670
I hope you, Mr. Cao,

30:37.470 --> 30:38.470
will forgive me.

30:39.500 --> 30:40.500
Miss Jiang.

30:42.220 --> 30:45.540
You can do whatever you want here.

30:46.420 --> 30:47.500
By the way, Miss Jiang,

30:47.500 --> 30:49.300
the young master from Yunhe Temple

30:49.300 --> 30:51.220
looks quite young.

30:51.430 --> 30:53.950
Why do you respect him so much?

30:54.830 --> 30:55.740
Could it be that

30:56.180 --> 30:58.980
this young master
really has some magical powers?

30:58.980 --> 31:01.740
The world is full of wonders.

31:02.910 --> 31:04.830
May I ask, do you believe

31:06.740 --> 31:09.200
that there are ghosts and gods
in this world?

31:10.460 --> 31:11.580
I do!

31:11.600 --> 31:13.700
It's because I believe
there are ghosts and gods in this world

31:13.700 --> 31:15.460
that I believe in karma.

31:15.870 --> 31:17.500
Because I believe in karma,

31:18.230 --> 31:19.990
I raised so many children.

31:20.190 --> 31:21.990
If it weren't for me, Cao San,

31:22.590 --> 31:25.520
these children
would have starved to death long ago.

31:27.080 --> 31:28.490
Mr. Cao, your righteousness

31:28.490 --> 31:29.900
is truly admirable.

31:30.540 --> 31:31.740
With this glass of...

31:32.020 --> 31:32.740
"key,"

31:34.020 --> 31:34.780
I toast you.

31:49.260 --> 31:50.700
I didn't expect you to have

31:50.700 --> 31:51.950
such a high tolerance for alcohol.

31:51.950 --> 31:52.300
Here.

31:52.500 --> 31:54.630
Let me refill your cup
with some more "key."

31:54.630 --> 31:55.460
I...

31:57.350 --> 31:58.980
Alright, alright.

31:59.010 --> 32:01.050
Drink more if you like it.

32:02.830 --> 32:03.830
Enjoy.

32:08.210 --> 32:09.140
Good "key!"

33:16.990 --> 33:18.250
Excuse me for a moment.

33:27.670 --> 33:29.150
Doggie!

33:30.300 --> 33:30.980
Master!

33:31.630 --> 33:32.500
Hurry up!

33:32.550 --> 33:33.110
Master!

33:33.980 --> 33:35.180
What are your orders?

33:42.150 --> 33:43.300
Who entered my room last night?

33:43.300 --> 33:44.220
Not me!

33:44.460 --> 33:46.190
Definitely not me!

33:46.390 --> 33:47.350
I was on night watch.

33:47.350 --> 33:49.260
I didn't even dare
to go to the toilet all night.

33:49.260 --> 33:51.320
Absolutely no one entered your room.

33:55.430 --> 33:56.230
Stop looking.

33:56.310 --> 33:57.460
Go get the car ready.

34:06.120 --> 34:06.840
Master!

34:11.270 --> 34:11.980
Master.

34:12.310 --> 34:13.020
It seems...

34:13.050 --> 34:14.250
something happened.

34:14.980 --> 34:16.429
Don't panic, Sect Leader Cao.

34:16.429 --> 34:18.540
Take your time and tell me what happened.

34:18.540 --> 34:20.100
When I woke up this morning,

34:20.540 --> 34:21.790
guess what I saw?

34:21.820 --> 34:24.820
The Dragon Throne
from the Palace of Heavenly Purity.

34:25.909 --> 34:27.270
That was my gift for you.

34:28.179 --> 34:30.310
You were born in the 16th year of Guangxu,

34:30.310 --> 34:32.310
which is the year of Gengyin, right?

34:32.949 --> 34:35.880
At 11:45 AM on the first day
of the fourth lunar month.

34:36.520 --> 34:38.330
The time matches perfectly.

34:38.870 --> 34:39.750
It seems

34:40.830 --> 34:43.030
Heaven will not destroy our Great Qing!

34:59.790 --> 35:00.580
Back then,

35:01.190 --> 35:02.600
after the Qing Army
entered the Central Plains,

35:02.600 --> 35:05.090
Prince Su of Heshuo
led his troops into Sichuan

35:05.090 --> 35:06.360
and defeated Zhang Xianzhong,

35:06.360 --> 35:08.360
making his name feared far and wide.

35:08.540 --> 35:09.340
It is said that

35:09.370 --> 35:11.570
Prince Su left his bloodline here.

35:13.500 --> 35:14.790
So you're saying...

35:15.030 --> 35:16.950
I'm related...

35:17.140 --> 35:18.340
to that whatever prince?

35:18.340 --> 35:20.860
Prince Su
was Emperor Taizong's eldest son,

35:21.420 --> 35:23.810
a member of the imperial clan
of the Yellow Sash.

35:23.810 --> 35:24.560
Now that

35:24.750 --> 35:27.620
the Japanese have severed
the dragon vein beyond Shanhai Pass,

35:27.620 --> 35:30.310
your branch
is the only legitimate bloodline

35:30.920 --> 35:32.960
of Prince Su left.

35:33.790 --> 35:34.500
Me?

35:34.910 --> 35:36.950
The burden of restoring Great Qing

35:40.020 --> 35:42.180
now falls on your shoulders.

36:09.790 --> 36:13.540
Long live Your Majesty!

36:13.870 --> 36:17.230
Long live Your Majesty!

36:17.390 --> 36:20.830
Long live Your Majesty!

36:21.390 --> 36:25.060
Long live Your Majesty!

36:25.620 --> 36:31.790
Long live Your Majesty!

36:45.830 --> 36:53.850
♪ In spring, the wind blows
and all things grow ♪

36:54.200 --> 37:03.010
♪ Flowers are red, leaves are green,
and grass is fresh ♪

37:03.540 --> 37:08.790
Beating around the bush.

37:04.230 --> 37:11.960
♪ All the flowers are in full bloom ♪

37:09.460 --> 37:13.310
I'll just play for a while.

37:15.920 --> 37:19.780
♪ Willow fluff fills the city ♪

37:16.910 --> 37:17.840
Did you see that?

37:17.910 --> 37:18.870
Did you see that?

37:19.310 --> 37:20.950
See? Did I lie to you?

37:20.950 --> 37:22.790
No, no.

37:38.910 --> 37:40.140
Kneel!

37:40.350 --> 37:43.870
Long live Your Majesty!

37:44.430 --> 37:47.870
Long live Your Majesty!

37:48.540 --> 37:52.310
Long live Your Majesty!

37:52.950 --> 37:56.710
Long live Your Majesty!

37:56.910 --> 38:00.140
Long live Your Majesty!

38:00.220 --> 38:03.220
Long live Your Majesty!

38:03.710 --> 38:04.540
I heard

38:04.660 --> 38:06.660
when those Beggar Sect leaders
knelt to him,

38:06.660 --> 38:08.500
Cao San was so full of himself.

38:09.750 --> 38:11.010
"To love only one's own

38:11.150 --> 38:12.620
and trust only their words."

38:12.620 --> 38:13.350
Understand?

38:13.850 --> 38:15.050
This is human nature.

38:17.910 --> 38:20.510
That fool should believe it by now, right?

38:23.620 --> 38:24.580
Seventy percent.

38:24.580 --> 38:25.580
Seventy percent?

38:26.870 --> 38:28.460
Then you should pull back the hook.

38:28.460 --> 38:29.180
No.

38:29.460 --> 38:30.980
When dealing with someone like Cao San,

38:30.980 --> 38:32.350
we can't make a move

38:32.460 --> 38:34.390
unless we're absolutely certain.

38:38.290 --> 38:39.330
It's your turn.

38:42.430 --> 38:43.180
Mr. Kui.

38:44.370 --> 38:45.600
Go get dressed up.

38:46.790 --> 38:47.830
Mr. Shangguan

38:47.860 --> 38:49.720
has already told us your identity.

38:49.720 --> 38:51.850
It's just that in these special times,

38:52.080 --> 38:53.680
we have to keep a low profile.

38:53.940 --> 38:55.080
This is the Fifth Master's place.

38:55.080 --> 38:56.340
It's private and safe,

38:56.350 --> 38:57.910
so you can rest assured.

38:58.010 --> 38:58.810
Fifth Master?

38:59.270 --> 39:00.060
I wouldn't dare.

39:00.060 --> 39:01.750
Why did you stand up?

39:02.200 --> 39:04.280
I was saying I...

39:05.270 --> 39:06.230
I also read it

39:06.260 --> 39:07.700
in the newspaper.

39:07.310 --> 39:08.170
[Mayor of Peiping Claims
that to Save the Country,]

39:07.880 --> 39:09.550
What's the situation

39:08.170 --> 39:09.040
[the Imperial System Must Be Restored]

39:09.770 --> 39:11.030
in the north right now?

39:11.300 --> 39:12.700
To answer your question.

39:13.460 --> 39:16.180
For a hundred years, foreign powers
have been invading our land.

39:16.180 --> 39:18.710
The whole nation has been fighting
to save itself and survive,

39:18.710 --> 39:20.720
carrying out
all kinds of reforms and revolutions.

39:20.720 --> 39:23.520
But in the end,
the whole country was left in ruins.

39:23.560 --> 39:26.120
And they are actually electing
a president?

39:26.310 --> 39:27.710
That's all wrong!

39:27.710 --> 39:29.430
Completely wrong!

39:29.750 --> 39:30.750
Those foreign things

39:30.750 --> 39:32.060
simply don't suit this

39:32.060 --> 39:33.980
great nation!

39:33.980 --> 39:34.580
Yes.

39:34.740 --> 39:36.070
For thousands of years,

39:36.140 --> 39:38.000
there has always been an emperor.

39:38.020 --> 39:39.230
Life went on as usual.

39:39.270 --> 39:40.910
Now there is no emperor,

39:41.270 --> 39:43.540
but the realm has become a mess.

39:43.710 --> 39:44.790
Look at those big shots.

39:44.790 --> 39:46.100
Today you hit me,

39:46.190 --> 39:47.460
and tomorrow I hit you.

39:47.490 --> 39:49.680
They only think about
how to get to the top.

39:49.680 --> 39:51.540
Who cares about the life and death
of the common people?

39:51.540 --> 39:52.350
Yes.

39:52.370 --> 39:53.330
If you ask me,

39:53.360 --> 39:55.470
it's better to have an emperor.

39:56.100 --> 39:56.910
Yes.

39:57.180 --> 39:58.380
My mother and brother

39:58.480 --> 40:00.950
died at the hands
of the revolutionary party back then.

40:00.950 --> 40:02.280
Master, you have no idea

40:02.580 --> 40:04.100
how miserably they died.

40:05.640 --> 40:06.840
But it's better now.

40:07.540 --> 40:08.660
We met you

40:08.910 --> 40:10.020
and found the true dragon.

40:10.020 --> 40:11.680
This is simply Heaven's will!

40:11.750 --> 40:13.390
The dragon vein has finally been restored.

40:13.390 --> 40:15.230
Our Great Qing will not perish!

40:15.230 --> 40:15.870
Yes!

40:16.020 --> 40:17.580
The Great Qing is saved!

40:23.230 --> 40:24.410
[Map of Great Qing]

41:10.010 --> 41:12.300
Greetings, Your Majesty.

41:32.940 --> 41:34.060
You may rise.

41:38.750 --> 41:39.540
Well,

41:39.570 --> 41:41.610
my subjects, you may rise.

41:41.910 --> 41:43.500
Thank you, Your Majesty.

41:48.160 --> 41:49.070
Your Majesty.

42:01.870 --> 42:03.130
Shangguan Chengming.

42:03.440 --> 42:04.840
At the enthronement ceremony,

42:04.840 --> 42:07.200
I will need you to pray for me.

42:07.540 --> 42:08.180
Yes.

42:08.270 --> 42:08.910
Well...

42:09.100 --> 42:09.790
I...

42:11.620 --> 42:13.870
I appoint you as State Preceptor.

42:14.610 --> 42:17.070
Hurry up and thank His Majesty
for his grace.

42:17.680 --> 42:18.460
Your Majesty,

42:18.460 --> 42:19.540
I'm not worthy

42:19.620 --> 42:20.300
of...

42:21.020 --> 42:22.880
the position of State Preceptor.

42:23.510 --> 42:24.030
Does...

42:25.020 --> 42:25.980
Does what I say

42:26.010 --> 42:27.410
not count?

42:30.300 --> 42:31.820
Yes, Your Majesty!

42:36.160 --> 42:40.380
♪ In spring, the wind blows ♪

42:40.230 --> 42:41.140
Alright.

42:40.410 --> 42:43.900
♪ And all things grow ♪

42:42.270 --> 42:43.660
Have all of you found a place to hide?

42:43.660 --> 42:45.100
Yes!

42:45.040 --> 42:50.020
♪ Flowers are red, leaves are green ♪

42:45.430 --> 42:47.390
Don't let me catch you,

42:47.660 --> 42:49.750
or you'll suffer!

42:50.040 --> 42:53.620
♪ And grass is fresh ♪

42:52.350 --> 42:53.620
This way!

42:54.230 --> 42:55.390
Your Majesty.

42:54.380 --> 42:57.780
♪ All the flowers ♪

42:58.280 --> 43:01.780
♪ are in full bloom ♪

42:59.790 --> 43:00.910
Your Majesty!

43:01.980 --> 43:03.100
Come catch me!

43:06.030 --> 43:09.380
♪ Willow fluff fills the city ♪

43:22.460 --> 43:24.580
Come on!

43:26.750 --> 43:28.080
My beloved concubines?

43:28.500 --> 43:30.180
Why are you all silent?

43:31.060 --> 43:33.060
Have all of you found a place to hide?

43:34.040 --> 43:35.480
Where are you?

43:41.290 --> 43:42.080
Caught you!

43:42.100 --> 43:43.980
You're going to suffer now!

43:49.830 --> 43:50.660
I didn't!

43:52.750 --> 43:54.410
I haven't even said anything,

43:54.690 --> 43:56.320
and you're already saying you didn't.

43:56.320 --> 43:57.430
You didn't do what?

43:58.760 --> 44:00.360
Not bad, San.

44:02.100 --> 44:04.660
So masculine!

44:05.020 --> 44:06.350
Playing with

44:06.580 --> 44:09.060
so many concubines all by yourself?

44:09.350 --> 44:10.980
You must be so happy.

44:11.030 --> 44:12.720
That's a bit disloyal of you.

44:12.860 --> 44:14.770
Why didn't you invite your father-in-law

44:14.770 --> 44:16.100
and share a few with him?

44:16.210 --> 44:17.360
Not cool.

44:19.110 --> 44:19.660
Kneel!

44:24.020 --> 44:24.950
I won't!

44:28.750 --> 44:29.750
Did you hear that?

44:29.890 --> 44:31.890
So masculine.

44:33.270 --> 44:34.710
Whose fan is this?

44:37.630 --> 44:39.760
His majesty is tired of playing today.

44:39.910 --> 44:40.830
Concubines,

44:41.400 --> 44:42.330
you may leave.

44:47.830 --> 44:49.230
Playing barefoot?

44:49.500 --> 44:51.620
How creative.

44:56.620 --> 44:58.240
You're still a good boy.

44:58.590 --> 45:00.840
You knelt down so fast.

45:01.320 --> 45:02.120
Your Majesty.

45:07.390 --> 45:08.190
Your Majesty,

45:08.340 --> 45:10.490
I brought you today's newspaper.

45:11.090 --> 45:13.780
What a coincidence.

45:13.980 --> 45:16.180
You little vixen, pushing your luck...

45:16.430 --> 45:16.910
Honey!

45:16.980 --> 45:17.660
Honey, don't!

45:17.660 --> 45:17.980
Let go of me!

45:17.980 --> 45:18.750
Run, Lingyu!

45:18.750 --> 45:19.660
Run!

45:19.790 --> 45:21.310
She's a monster who eats people alive!

45:21.310 --> 45:22.310
Run!

45:22.430 --> 45:23.070
Let go!

45:23.140 --> 45:23.880
Run!

45:24.390 --> 45:25.270
Let me go!

45:28.580 --> 45:29.580
Stop right there!

45:30.140 --> 45:31.500
Still trying to run, huh?

45:31.500 --> 45:33.100
How dare you fight back!

45:34.430 --> 45:35.090
Don't move!

45:53.130 --> 45:54.700
The sun has set.

45:54.720 --> 45:56.660
You can't still be having a nosebleed.

45:56.660 --> 45:58.180
Throw it away.

46:00.060 --> 46:01.660
It stopped bleeding, right?

46:02.380 --> 46:03.020
Honey.

46:04.440 --> 46:06.120
I think I really am a dragon.

46:08.790 --> 46:10.180
If you are a dragon,

46:10.180 --> 46:12.020
then I am a phoenix.

46:12.050 --> 46:12.820
Exactly.

46:13.100 --> 46:14.170
We are a perfect match.

46:14.170 --> 46:16.260
Perfect match, my foot!

46:19.510 --> 46:21.110
Look, Honey.

46:21.870 --> 46:22.980
So pitiful.

46:23.140 --> 46:24.310
Now it's this side.

46:24.390 --> 46:26.230
It's fine. You have a lot of blood.

46:26.230 --> 46:27.350
I'm full of vigor.

46:27.370 --> 46:28.120
Right.

46:29.390 --> 46:29.950
Honey,

46:30.180 --> 46:30.980
you have no idea

46:30.980 --> 46:31.790
how amazing

46:32.290 --> 46:33.400
that master is.

46:33.620 --> 46:34.580
He took a...

46:34.620 --> 46:35.850
A magical artifact, I guess.

46:35.850 --> 46:37.310
He used that to look at my scar.

46:37.310 --> 46:38.640
At that time, my scar...

46:39.870 --> 46:41.470
It glowed with golden light.

46:41.710 --> 46:43.660
Then the master said that my scar

46:43.870 --> 46:45.230
is a dragon vein.

46:45.310 --> 46:46.180
Really?

46:46.580 --> 46:47.390
That amazing?

46:47.390 --> 46:47.870
Yes.

46:47.990 --> 46:49.590
What else did the master say?

46:49.790 --> 46:51.270
Well, the master said

46:51.980 --> 46:52.980
that actually,

46:53.100 --> 46:54.310
I'm not Han Chinese.

46:54.830 --> 46:55.910
I'm Manchu,

46:56.160 --> 46:59.170
a descendant of some...

46:59.440 --> 47:00.520
Prince Su.

47:01.540 --> 47:03.390
My surname is Aisin Gioro.

47:03.390 --> 47:04.230
He said that.

47:05.790 --> 47:07.500
Your surname is Aisin Gioro?

47:08.650 --> 47:10.120
Do you love my feet?

47:12.180 --> 47:14.180
If your surname is Aisin Gioro,

47:14.830 --> 47:17.080
then I am Goddess Nyuwa.

47:17.100 --> 47:18.620
My surname could also be Aisin something.

47:18.620 --> 47:20.660
I could be Aisin Kick-Your-Ass!

47:23.980 --> 47:25.230
What kind of behavior is this?

47:25.230 --> 47:26.270
Looking like this,

47:26.270 --> 47:27.490
how can you be the Empress in the future?

47:27.490 --> 47:28.460
With you as my husband,

47:28.460 --> 47:29.680
I can never be the Empress!

47:29.680 --> 47:30.580
I can only be a tough wife!

47:30.580 --> 47:31.350
Kneel!

47:32.700 --> 47:33.140
Honey.

47:33.980 --> 47:35.710
Do you really think I'm stupid?

47:35.980 --> 47:36.940
Let me tell you,

47:36.960 --> 47:38.180
I've been completely clear-headed

47:38.180 --> 47:39.620
from the very beginning.

47:40.060 --> 47:41.710
Did we spend a single penny?

47:41.750 --> 47:43.020
We didn't spend a penny

47:43.020 --> 47:44.660
and got so many treasures for free.

47:44.660 --> 47:46.660
Haven't they been looking for some

47:46.690 --> 47:48.210
true dragon?

47:48.270 --> 47:49.790
Don't they love acting?

47:49.790 --> 47:51.660
I've just been playing along with them.

47:51.660 --> 47:52.790
Actually, I'm the one

47:52.790 --> 47:54.230
playing them for fools.

47:56.090 --> 47:57.930
What should I say to you?

47:58.390 --> 47:59.910
In this world,

48:00.450 --> 48:02.100
free things

48:02.350 --> 48:04.310
are the most expensive.

48:05.310 --> 48:07.870
Those people are probably all scammers.

48:08.100 --> 48:10.020
The junk they gave you

48:10.350 --> 48:11.750
is probably all fake.

48:11.750 --> 48:13.480
Do you understand, blockhead?

48:13.840 --> 48:14.760
It's fake.

48:15.420 --> 48:17.230
There's no such thing in the palace.

48:17.230 --> 48:18.230
Jerks.

48:18.950 --> 48:20.750
I knew these people

48:20.750 --> 48:21.950
were up to no good.

48:22.790 --> 48:23.660
Madam,

48:23.870 --> 48:25.980
what else did they show you?

48:26.000 --> 48:27.130
What else is there to see?

48:27.130 --> 48:28.730
Isn't it just a bunch of junk?

48:33.470 --> 48:34.550
By the way, Eunuch,

48:35.270 --> 48:36.540
there's one more thing

48:36.890 --> 48:39.600
that I'm afraid even you haven't seen.

48:40.680 --> 48:41.760
What is it?

48:42.500 --> 48:43.830
The Dragon Throne.

48:44.790 --> 48:46.230
The Dragon Throne?

48:47.430 --> 48:49.490
This is the biggest joke in the world.

48:49.520 --> 48:50.690
The Dragon Throne

48:50.720 --> 48:53.550
is in the Palace Museum in Peiping.

48:54.790 --> 48:55.580
Right.

48:56.100 --> 48:57.090
If the Dragon Throne

48:57.090 --> 48:59.190
is in the Palace Museum in Peiping,

48:59.620 --> 49:01.790
then what did I see?

49:02.470 --> 49:03.240
Eunuch.

49:04.350 --> 49:05.100
Have...

49:05.820 --> 49:08.930
Have you really seen the Dragon Throne?

49:09.140 --> 49:11.180
Of course I have.

49:11.420 --> 49:15.100
I've even seen the crack
the little emperor

49:15.230 --> 49:16.420
kicked into it.

49:16.440 --> 49:18.660
That little emperor was quite naughty,

49:18.750 --> 49:20.750
putting a crack in the Dragon Throne.

49:20.750 --> 49:22.190
When we were in the palace

49:22.390 --> 49:23.180
serving our masters,

49:23.180 --> 49:25.540
we weren't allowed
to look them in the eye.

49:25.830 --> 49:28.360
So I looked at this Dragon Throne
for 20 years.

49:28.540 --> 49:31.310
Who could know better than I do
if it's real or fake?

49:31.310 --> 49:33.310
If that's the case, Eunuch,

49:33.690 --> 49:36.210
I'll have to ask you for a favor

49:36.540 --> 49:37.670
and come with me.

49:37.870 --> 49:38.390
Okay.

49:38.420 --> 49:39.150
Come on.

49:39.200 --> 49:40.320
Thank you.

49:43.400 --> 49:45.570
[In the next episode]

49:45.710 --> 49:46.790
What exactly happened?

49:46.790 --> 49:47.900
A few men suddenly rushed in

49:47.900 --> 49:48.880
and started shooting!

49:48.880 --> 49:49.960
They seemed to be Japanese!

49:49.960 --> 49:51.930
He is the Eastern Divine Dragon!

49:51.950 --> 49:53.550
Hurry! Protect the Emperor!

49:53.560 --> 49:54.480
My beloved!

49:54.540 --> 49:55.730
The assassination attempt means

49:55.730 --> 49:58.040
Your Majesty's identity and whereabouts
have been exposed!

49:58.040 --> 49:59.160
The most important thing right now

49:59.160 --> 50:01.160
is to move you to a safe place.

50:01.310 --> 50:03.570
Your Majesty, the train leaves tonight.

50:03.880 --> 50:06.570
I'll go with Fifth Master
to arrange your itinerary.

50:06.570 --> 50:07.570
Wait.
